OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog inspectors flag prison
OL,4,Aeducation concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Significant problems" with education,
OL,7,Fskills and work provision at a prison
OL,8,Ffor sex offenders have been found by
OL,9,Finspectors.
OL,11,FHM Inspectorate of Prisons visited HMP
OL,12,FBure, on the former RAF Coltishall site
OL,13,Fnear North Walsham, in June.
OL,15,FThe category C jail, which holds 636
OL,16,Fmen convicted of sexual offences, has
OL,17,Ffive concerns outstanding from its last
OL,18,Finspection in 2023, according to the
OL,19,Fnew report.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
