OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog inspectors flag prison
OL,4,Aeducation concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlie Taylor, HM Chief Inspector of
OL,7,FPrisons, said: "There is much to
OL,8,Flike... and if sickness-driven staffing
OL,9,Fshortages can be reduced, and the
OL,10,Fprison service can create and fund more
OL,11,Fhigh-quality activity spaces, then the
OL,12,Fprison can begin to fulfil more
OL,13,Feffectively its role as a training
OL,14,Fprison."
